[{"answer":"Right, Jason and Karin,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/1.mp3"},{"answer":"now I asked you to look at the case study for Box Telecom as part of your exam assessment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/2.mp3"},{"answer":"It's interesting because they are in the middle of problems at the moment","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/3.mp3"},{"answer":"and I want you to track how they deal with them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's start with you, Karin.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Having read through the case study,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/6.mp3"},{"answer":"can you just summarise what the problems were that Box Telecom had to take on board?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Um, yeah...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Well of course what first came to their attention was that, despite a new advertising campaign,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/9.mp3"},{"answer":"they were suffering from falling sales -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/10.mp3"},{"answer":"and this is something that had many causes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/11.mp3"},{"answer":"On top of that immediate problem,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/12.mp3"},{"answer":"what had also happened over the last two years was that,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/13.mp3"},{"answer":"although they had invested in an expansion plan,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/14.mp3"},{"answer":"they had to face up to increased competition.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/15.mp3"},{"answer":"And, before they had a chance to get to grips with the effects of that,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/16.mp3"},{"answer":"they were stalled by a strike","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/17.mp3"},{"answer":"and it was just when they were thinking about making a colossal investment in new machinery for their plants.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/18.mp3"},{"answer":"So they were really in trouble.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I think that's fair.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/20.mp3"},{"answer":"And Jason, you contacted the company, didn't you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/21.mp3"},{"answer":"What did the company define as the reasons for these problems?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I think they've hit on the right things -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/23.mp3"},{"answer":"it would be easy to say they had invested too heavily, or at the wrong time,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/24.mp3"},{"answer":"but in fact, the signs were good","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/25.mp3"},{"answer":"and what they were set back by was high interest rates.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/26.mp3"},{"answer":"At the same time, their longer-term problems, which were affecting their market share,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/27.mp3"},{"answer":"were eventually credited to poor training -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/28.mp3"},{"answer":"and having looked at the details in their last report I think that's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/29.mp3"},{"answer":"So, onto the larger issues then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Karin, what do you think the company will do?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Obviously they have the choice of accepting the very favourable terms that another company - KMG Plc - have given them to buy them out.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/32.mp3"},{"answer":"That would mean creating a new company with a new image.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Or they could decide on a bolder move and offer some new shares if they wanted.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/34.mp3"},{"answer":"But I think they're much more cautious than that","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/35.mp3"},{"answer":"and expect they will start trying to find individuals who'd be prepared to back them with some of the capital they need.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, you mustn't always assume that dramatic problems require dramatic solutions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Sometimes there's a simple fix such as changing the guy at the top.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/38.mp3"},{"answer":"If they truly are cautious,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/39.mp3"},{"answer":"then I suspect they will seek to shut down some of their shops.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/40.mp3"},{"answer":"But a more ambitious approach,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/41.mp3"},{"answer":"and one which I think would have more chance of success,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/42.mp3"},{"answer":"would be to alter how they're running things -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/43.mp3"},{"answer":"the management layers and the processes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/44.mp3"},{"answer":"So, in your analysis, try to think of all the options.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Jason?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it's interesting because I've found it a really useful company to study.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Its problems cross all types of industries","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/48.mp3"},{"answer":"and it's lucky it's so big -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/49.mp3"},{"answer":"a smaller or even medium-sized company would have gone under by now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah well in fact, what I want you two to do","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/51.mp3"},{"answer":"is to go away when we've finished our discussion today and write a report.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/52.mp3"},{"answer":"We've looked in general at the telecommunications market in the UK over the last few sessions","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/53.mp3"},{"answer":"and I want you to take Box Telecom as an example","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/54.mp3"},{"answer":"and suggest some ways in which they might overcome their problems.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/55.mp3"},{"answer":"And outline the reasons why you think as you do -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/56.mp3"},{"answer":"but try and keep it intrinsic to the company","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/57.mp3"},{"answer":"rather than dragging in other examples.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that okay, Karin?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I think I can do that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Personally I've got great hopes for it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/61.mp3"},{"answer":"I think it will recover.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/62.mp3"},{"answer":"That advertising campaign they did was very strong","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/63.mp3"},{"answer":"and they're very innovative with their products - they set new trends.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/64.mp3"},{"answer":"The company's got to recover, don't you think, Jason?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm... I'm not sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/66.mp3"},{"answer":"I think it can but it's not a foregone conclusion","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/67.mp3"},{"answer":"unless they manage to attract the right level of investment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/68.mp3"},{"answer":"The company definitely needs a boost","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/69.mp3"},{"answer":"and to attract more highly skilled workers if their recovery is to be long-lasting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/70.mp3"},{"answer":"When I was talking to the marketing manager","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/71.mp3"},{"answer":"he said to me that he thinks the company had got a great management team","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/72.mp3"},{"answer":"but he would say that, wouldn't he?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/73.mp3"},{"answer":"but they are suffering from having to work with outdated production machinery","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/74.mp3"},{"answer":"and that could cost a lot to put right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, personally I think the stock market is to blame.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/76.mp3"},{"answer":"I think they were expecting too much of the company","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/77.mp3"},{"answer":"and then inevitably it looked bad when it didn't perform.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/78.mp3"},{"answer":"The market should have had more realistic expectations.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/79.mp3"},{"answer":"And I disagree with you about the advertising campaign, Karin.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/80-2023-09-05-16-17-42.mp3"},{"answer":"That's where they could do with some innovation - to get sales kick-started.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/81.mp3"},{"answer":"Anyway, let's see what you come up with...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-3-2023-08-09-22-34-54/82.mp3"}]
